        {
          "field": "stem",
          "before": null,
          "after": "When a polynomial \\(f(x)\\) is divided by \\(2x+1\\), the remainder is \\(R\\). Find the remainder when \\(f(2x+1)\\) is divided by \\(4x+3\\)."
        },
        {
          "field": "stemZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "多項式 \\(f(x)\\) 除以 \\(2x+1\\) 的餘式為 \\(R\\)。求 \\(f(2x+1)\\) 除以 \\(4x+3\\) 的餘式。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solution",
          "before": null,
          "after": "The given remainder is \\(f(-\\frac12)=R\\). The new divisor vanishes at \\(x=-\\frac34\\), where \\(2x+1=-\\frac12\\). Thus the new remainder is \\(R\\)."
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "已知 \\(f(-\\frac12)=R\\)。新除式的零點為 \\(x=-\\frac34\\)，此時 \\(2x+1=-\\frac12\\)，所以新餘式仍為 \\(R\\)。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionStatus",
          "before": null,
          "after": "independently-rederived"
        },
        {
          "field": "source",
