        {
          "field": "stem",
          "before": null,
          "after": "Let \\(g(x)\\) be a polynomial divisible by \\(x+1\\). Then \\(g(4x-5)\\) must be divisible by which expression?"
        },
        {
          "field": "stemZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "設多項式 \\(g(x)\\) 可被 \\(x+1\\) 整除，則 \\(g(4x-5)\\) 必可被下列哪個式子整除？"
        },
        {
          "field": "solution",
