        {
          "field": "stem",
          "before": null,
          "after": "Let \\(f(x)=2x^2+ax-2\\), where \\(a\\) is a constant. If \\(f(x)\\) is divisible by \\(2x-1\\), find the remainder when \\(f(x)\\) is divided by \\(x-a\\)."
        },
        {
          "field": "stemZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "設 \\(f(x)=2x^2+ax-2\\)，其中 \\(a\\) 為常數。若 \\(f(x)\\) 可被 \\(2x-1\\) 整除，求 \\(f(x)\\) 除以 \\(x-a\\) 的餘式。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solution",
          "before": null,
          "after": "\\(f(\\frac12)=0\\) gives \\[\\begin{gathered}\\frac12 +\\frac a2 \\\\ -2 =0\\end{gathered}\\], hence \\(a=3\\). The required remainder is \\(f(3)=18+9-2=25\\)."
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "由 \\(f(\\frac12)=0\\) 得 \\[\\begin{gathered}\\frac12 +\\frac a2 \\\\ -2 =0\\end{gathered}\\]，所以 \\(a=3\\)。所求餘式為 \\(f(3)=18+9-2=25\\)。"
        },
