        {
          "field": "stem",
          "before": null,
          "after": "Let \\[\\begin{gathered}f(x) =2x^3 +px^2 \\\\ -2qx -25\\end{gathered}\\], where \\(p,q\\) are constants. If \\(f(x)\\) is divisible by \\(x-5\\) and \\(2x+1\\), find the remainder when it is divided by \\(x+1\\)."
        },
        {
          "field": "stemZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "設 \\[\\begin{gathered}f(x) =2x^3 +px^2 \\\\ -2qx -25\\end{gathered}\\]，其中 \\(p,q\\) 為常數。若 \\(f(x)\\) 可被 \\(x-5\\) 及 \\(2x+1\\) 整除，求它除以 \\(x+1\\) 的餘式。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solution",
          "before": null,
          "after": "\\(f(5)=0\\) gives \\(5p-2q=-45\\). \\(f(-\\frac12)=0\\) gives \\(p+4q=101\\). Solving yields \\(p=1,q=25\\). Then \\[\\begin{gathered}f(-1) = -2 +1 +50 \\\\ -25 =24\\end{gathered}\\]"
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "由 \\(f(5)=0\\) 得 \\(5p-2q=-45\\)；由 \\(f(-\\frac12)=0\\) 得 \\(p+4q=101\\)。聯立解得 \\(p=1,q=25\\)，所以 \\[\\begin{gathered}f(-1) = -2 +1 +50 \\\\ -25 =24\\end{gathered}\\]"
        },
